d the United Arab Emirates. The company formulates and manufactures specialty chemicals used in drilling, production, and refining operations; and trades in specialty and industrial chemicals, including catalysts, sulfiding agents, fuel additives, dyes, hydrogen peroxide, calcium nitrate, and others. It also provides related technical support services; and management services. The company was founded in 2010 and is headquartered in Bandar Puncak Alam, Malaysia. Sumisaujana Group Berhad operates as a subsidiary of Atreon Holdings Sdn Bhd.","zh":"Sumisaujana Group Berhad 成立于 2010 年，总部位于马来西亚 Bandar Puncak Alam，通过子公司制造和供应油气特种化学品，业务覆盖马来西亚、泰国、印度尼西亚、沙特阿拉伯、阿曼、澳大利亚、中国、科威特和阿联酋等地，是 Atreon Holdings Sdn Bhd 的子公司。","lines":["油气特种化学品：配制和生产用于钻井、生产和炼油作业的特种化学品，客户为油气行业企业。","特种及工业化学品贸易：贸易催化剂、硫化剂、燃料添加剂、染料、过氧化氢、硝酸钙等特种和工业化学品。","相关技术支持服务：提供与化学品相关的技术支持服务。","管理服务：提供管理服务。"],"lines_en":["Oil and gas specialty chemicals: formulates and manufactures specialty chemicals used in drilling, production, and refining operations for oil and gas customers.","Specialty and industrial chemicals trading: trades catalysts, sulfiding agents, fuel additives, dyes, hydrogen peroxide, calcium nitrate, and other specialty and industrial chemicals.","Related technical support services: provides technical support services related to its chemicals.","Management services: provides management services."]}}